      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">and honor [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the manner of wives [... in purity]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and cleanness. And [this] Sitt [al-Bayt] appointed ...[...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">of this Shemarya. She [willingly] consented to all that he does in [the affair of her marriage.... And there testified to her]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[t]wo witnesses, in our presence. They fixed between themselves the\u00a0 ... [marriage payment... , X dinars]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">of which, the advanced portion of the mohar, were included in her dowry. [And] there remain incumbent upon [him] sixty d[inars.]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">She has no [r]ight to claim o[f] them one per[u]\u1e6da, as long as he is alive [... These are what]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">she brought in with her: (the) household furnishings and clo[thing]; evaluated...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[which] this Sitt al-Bayt [br]ought in. [And these are for her and her son] after her, i[f she dies ...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">which remains from this dowry. And if she dies without children ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[in tw]o portions, equally. One portion, [will] be acq[uired] by [her] husb[and ...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] from beginning to end. And [they] accepted ...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... thi]s [marriage contract ...] wherever it is [produced ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">...\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
